		(uuid "429b1e08-b44f-4b14-b7ab-dcd4c79527eb")
	)
	(text "Lamp matrix row drivers. Row register 0x3FE4: bit(k-1)=1 turns row k on, clocked by /LMP ROW (J113-7). The 74HCT74 latches the data bit (true after U9); Q high -> IRLR024N on\n(row = ground, ~65-80 mOhm DPAK). Over-current: source sense 0.22 R -> 1k/100n -> LM339; above the 1.4 V reference (6 A) the open-collector\noutput pulls ~CLR low and the row is shut off until the next strobe. BLANKING pulls REF_1V4 low (CPU sheet) so all rows are forced off.\nRow k = Q(91-k): row1=Q90 ... row8=Q83. Outputs J133/J135 (pins 1,2,4-9; key 3)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "43475e55-80ca-48d9-b776-cd4d85a05f5b")
	)
